{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive a Hostile World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a strange planet that changes with each death. Traverse unique biomes, each offering their own challenges that you'll have to adapt to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover abilities that change the way you interact with the world. You might learn to burrow through earth or bounce off of it like a ball. Each one has multiple uses to find, each of which will help you solve puzzles and access new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Encounter Strange Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each biome is home to a unique ecosystem, full of lifeforms that might help or hurt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is dense and full of things to find. With each life and death, you'll discover new knowledge about the world to help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/mutawalk.png?t=1741643407\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507690?t=1741643407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507690?t=1741643407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/1cfad34b69d745547fade66604878054c4fc068d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741643407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/1cfad34b69d745547fade66604878054c4fc068d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741643407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive a Hostile World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a